00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:10.600
They would switch away to another tab, it would run completely unsupervised

242
00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.840
until it was done, and then they would review the code

243
00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:17.440
locally and effectively provide PR review via the chat interface.

244
00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.880
So it's not as big a leap as it sounds.

245
00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.440
And once you do this now

246
00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.440
everything is running through like a very persistent ledger, right?

247
00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:27.920
You have the issue contains the initial prompt.

