00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.960
like a code review tool or something, all of that feedback,

250
00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.480
all in very durable places that are easy to pull down with open tools.

251
00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:42.400
And so it just sets the groundwork for that continuous loop.

252
00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:46.280
So when we started moving to this, the first thing that we hit was

