00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.320
to arrange your furniture.

362
00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:00.320
And so it's a really nice way of quickly getting up to speed

363
00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:00.880
and then saying,

364
00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:03.280
actually, this is fit for purpose, this is good enough,

365
00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:05.920
or do we need something that actually works at the way?

366
00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.160
Do we need to handcraft something,

367
00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:10.240
or do we need to buy something else to replace and plug it in?

368
00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:13.080
And it's that extensibility as well as that, that defaults

369
00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:16.760
good defaults that allow you to get up to speed quickly

370
00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:18.320
and then decide what you need.

371
00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:22.320
This is something we've seen across pretty much every successful customer who

